[{"title":"霁","author":"范汭","text":"肃肃池上雨，雨收池更寒。\n从来通醉理，自此豁幽端。\n螮蝀饮方歇，鸧鹒鸣欲阑。\n褰裳转溪路，晴瀑少人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2012,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄答邓明府","author":"范汭","text":"黄池路远近，此别遂茫然。\n颜色既不接，音书空复传。\n省耕春草外，退食晚花前。\n闻道无留事，闲情异往年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2013,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临安","author":"范汭","text":"舍筏愁将夕，墟烟极望平。\n余花红半委，初笋绿丛生。\n水漫鱼登市，山昏鸟入城。\n心心天目路，只解向西行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2014,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊虎丘同刘元声伯仲","author":"范汭","text":"翳然一片雨，远沐脊山青。\n举棹兴方属，引觞歌莫停。\n林钟去杳杳，川火来荧荧。\n坐待月轮出，僧寮犹未扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2015,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过武陵怀龙观察","author":"范汭","text":"去指黔乡近，回瞻楚甸遥。\n郡门临白浪，驿路叠青霄。\n积雨寒初霁，长烟湿未消。\n征鞍停不可，无赖是今朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2016,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平溪","author":"范汭","text":"停骖古城曲，薄暮往来稀。\n濑响生官舍，崖寒中客衣。\n叶雕花簇簇，雷迸雪霏霏。\n欲寄乡园信，黔南断雁飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2017,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贵筑憩越孝廉别业","author":"范汭","text":"结宇数蜂间，泓渟一水湾。\n谷风过午冷，原树入秋闲。\n苔动璟鳞戏，花摇翠羽还。\n谁知于役者，弥日此开颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2018,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访葛震父","author":"范汭","text":"村村鸥鹜群，寺寺冷斜曛。\n渡口独来客，岩中重访君。\n鼓声鱼市接，帆影稻畦分。\n看取前楹竹，新枝碍白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2019,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望茅山残雪","author":"范汭","text":"华阳望不极，缕缕晴烟生。\n斜日半山雪，照人巾舄清。\n渐融仍合沓，近晦逾空明。\n强载笋舆去，摇摇人外情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2020,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贻董六遐周","author":"范汭","text":"春来春去总无端，别院沉沉独倚栏。\n风抑疏花仍怯晚，雨撩纤柳不胜寒。\n离情泣向缄中诉，怨色偷从镜里看。\n咫尺巫阳峰十二，片云还往若为难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2021,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登缥缈峰","author":"范汭","text":"天近笋舆如踏空，翻翻巾舄冷泠风。\n远寻乱嶂出帆外，近数诸村悬镜中。\n沙草微茫似楚泽，涧花凄冷非吴宫。\n湖西湖东尽堪望，两地乡心谁与同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2022,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"响屟廊","author":"范汭","text":"越艳迹如扫，年年烧痕绿。\n归僧踏岭云，枯叶声相触。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2023,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠杨孝父","author":"范汭","text":"清时有隐者，自汲还自耘。\n翳然茅屋上，一片尧时云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2024,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游弁山","author":"范汭","text":"一峰际苍苍，遐瞩了无碍。\n湖色上人颜，崖阴落鸟背。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2025,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送彦平游岭南","author":"范汭","text":"九月罗浮道，无衣亦不寒。\n奇峰三十二，直作夏云看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2026,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发","author":"范汭","text":"春水动微茫，帆前即异乡。\n鸡声残月堕，人语隔寒塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2027,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平越道中","author":"范汭","text":"晴时十二三，雨时十七八。\n山鸟何预人，连声泥滑滑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2028,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秣陵送李茂才","author":"范汭","text":"一雨绿千里，楚山如近人。\n留君君掉首，何处秣陵春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2029,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤德生兄","author":"范汭","text":"昔时君好饮，卮酒不停持。\n今日坟前土，徒然酹一卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2030,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭费元朗","author":"范汭","text":"书随讣音至，半信半相猜。\n莫谓无期别，犹知有梦来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2031,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝笔","author":"范汭","text":"愁来遣不可，流目今成昔。\n向夕空馆寒，栟榈摵摵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2032,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南唐宫词四首 其一","author":"范汭","text":"桃李花开点御沟，翠华经月不曾游。\n内庭鸱吻移鸱尾，莫问君王十四州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2033,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南唐宫词四首 其二","author":"范汭","text":"女冠鸟爪解方音，识得蓬瀛路浅深。\n戏搦雪花熔紫磨，汉宫谁数辟寒金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2034,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南唐宫词四首 其三","author":"范汭","text":"半檐日影漾罘罳，才是深宫梦觉时。\n敕取烧槽弹法曲，声声声诉恨来迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2035,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南唐宫词四首 其四","author":"范汭","text":"苑门深闭柳千条，银箭听残夜寂寥。\n刬下阶羞见影，不知斜月弄芭蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2036,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王蜀宫词二首 其一","author":"范汭","text":"匼匝渠穿宛转桥，绮楼香暖月迢迢。\n海南蜃市浑无异，添得歌声堕九霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2037,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王蜀宫词二首 其二","author":"范汭","text":"玉脸匀朱卸翠冠，宣华池上绕阑干。\n醉妆邀取君王顾，一任东风料峭寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2038,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孟蜀官词二首 其一","author":"范汭","text":"池西别殿署凌波，杨柳风微月渐多。\n珠箔卷来秋似水，填词惟教艳娘歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2039,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孟蜀官词二首 其二","author":"范汭","text":"猩红栀子艺成林，复砌勾栏日映深。\n隔院似闻催羯鼓，先开一朵是同心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2040,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南汉宫词二首 其一","author":"范汭","text":"珊瑚裁辇玉装车，夕醉明蟾晓醉花。\n南海南边天漫漫，君臣无梦到中华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2041,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南汉宫词二首 其二","author":"范汭","text":"金猊香袅日靡靡，玉陛连朝奏事稀。\n驯兽近前亲射杀，血花吹污侍臣衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2042,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闽宫词二首 其一","author":"范汭","text":"露华如水蘸宫墙，红豆花兼荔子香。\n多少峨眉闲待月，九龙帐底贮归郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2043,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闽宫词二首 其二","author":"范汭","text":"四条弦上按新声，半是先皇手教成。\n旧事内人谁敢泄，春来燕子不呼名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2044,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴越宫词二首 其一","author":"范汭","text":"春柳遥遥绿渐浓，秋花间色种芙蓉。\n苑中别有西湖水，一缕云随不睡龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2045,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴越宫词二首 其二","author":"范汭","text":"千门斜月四窗星，山近帘衣分外青。\n侍女夜间眠不稳，御床圆枕缀金铃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2046,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"板桥曲","author":"范汭","text":"板桥断后无复春，蒲荒柳秃波粼粼。\n依稀一片昔时月，来照鸳鸯不照人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2047,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇中词三首 其一","author":"范汭","text":"秀海海边葭菼秋，滇池池上云悠悠。\n人心恰似此中水，一道南流一北流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇中词三首 其二","author":"范汭","text":"鸳鸯浦绿水如苔，镜里人家向背开。\n五目爨僮劖雪去，三冬僰女担花来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇中词三首 其三","author":"范汭","text":"迤西之西天一涯，四时长有三春花。\n青帘飐处客沽酒，五岁女郎能数蚆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送一公还天界寺","author":"范汭","text":"江流汩汩树层层，短笠瓢空去秣陵。\n依旧青山风雪里，筚门深掩一龛灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴凝甫兼简讯公","author":"范汭","text":"天远湖南渔火稀，隔林钟磬度微微。\n不知此夕幽人兴，月出僧房归未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荆溪","author":"范汭","text":"乱水声中系艇斜，月寒沽酒扣谁家。\n仙源咫尺不知处，红叶吹来如落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松陵舟中迟钱受之太史","author":"范汭","text":"几家闲夜停机杼，支枕篷窗风许许。\n吹尽莼香不见人，绕塘寒月鵁鶄语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泖上嘲吴凝父","author":"范汭","text":"林皋叶脱风凄凄，远峰森立寒云齐。\n满船离思半江月，未到五更鸡乱啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧","author":"范汭","text":"采香泾上黄鸟啼，藤梢掠云笋迸泥。\n来时即是去时路，师向此中应不迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春闲居和荩卿侄","author":"范汭","text":"舍南舍北雨声催，款款闲鸥逐队来。\n欲买鱼虾唤江艇，楝花临水筚门开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄邵隐之","author":"范汭","text":"与君握手未经时，一水空悬别后思。\n心事茫茫谁共语，自持椒酒酹要离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送茅荐卿水部使还留都","author":"范汭","text":"霅溪春水接长干，五日邮程去不难。\n问寝但留诸弟在，双鱼容易报平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日讯吴允兆","author":"范汭","text":"远树微波黯不分，阖闾城畔寄孤云。\n春来尽有还乡梦，除却青山便是君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊梁溪","author":"范汭","text":"樯上乌啼月满滩，月和残雪耐人看。\n半炉爇尽沉香火，消受篷窗一夜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2061,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊燕子矶","author":"范汭","text":"山影沉沉日乍红，峭帆人怯剪江风。\n鸥凫占我曾题石，一半㟏岈叠浪中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2062,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄阮坚之司理二首 其一","author":"范汭","text":"讼庭寂寂散春烟，碧海丹山在目前。\n市得虾姑堪佐酒，摘来荔子不论钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2063,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄阮坚之司理二首 其二","author":"范汭","text":"别时江草冷萧萧，再见春光上柳条。\n万一故人生远梦，也应先过伯通桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲冬","author":"范汭","text":"仲冬之交气不齐，桃花李花开满溪。\n行人认是二三月，只少黄鹂枝上啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岘山晚归","author":"范汭","text":"近嶂远空同蔚蓝，画船不系酒微酣。\n疏疏灯影出烟际，隐隐人声在水南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王曰常","author":"范汭","text":"一月留君兴未阑，酒杯无限费春寒。\n海棠欲卸辛夷尽，取次看花到牡丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西家","author":"范汭","text":"蛾眉不扫鬓云斜，含怨含情未破瓜。\n背倚曲栏花一树，春光多少属西家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遇俞献父","author":"范汭","text":"与汝垂髫共里闾，别来不省六年余。\n情知一见又成别，犹胜逢人数寄书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧入庐山","author":"范汭","text":"霜天一衲影萧萧，别路无多觉路遥。\n他日有人来入社，不妨行过虎溪桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代茅止生悼亡姬三首 其一","author":"范汭","text":"深阁鸟鸣人到稀，柳风吹绿上帘衣。\n香魂化作彩霞缕，时绕华阳洞口飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代茅止生悼亡姬三首 其二","author":"范汭","text":"独夜寒侵半臂绫，锁窗花影隔层层。\n依稀梦里还寻梦，才到钱塘又秣陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代茅止生悼亡姬三首 其三","author":"范汭","text":"莺雏出壳月将四，燕子营巢春已三。\n看取西陵埋玉处，不生松柏长宜男。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迟吴凝父不至","author":"范汭","text":"故人宛何在，坐永芳时别。\n别时樱桃花，离离子堪撷。\n颓云忽成峰，喧禽将反舌。\n触绪怅多违，丝棼焉可绝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重送戚不磷游登封","author":"范汭","text":"入门复出门，平畴绿如砥。\n春风吹柳花，随君日千里。\n望望缑山云，心轻别妻子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词四首 其一","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"青山是处锁蛾眉，日日湖边有别离。\n却怪烟波三万顷，扁舟只许载西施。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词四首 其二","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"江南一雪苦非常，湖上空余橘柚乡。\n万树千头零落尽，于今那得洞庭霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词四首 其三","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"湖船来往惯风波，尾后黄旗飞虎图。\n一夜王程三百里，枇杷明日进留都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2078,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词四首 其四","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"南濠有客寄书还，夫婿黄柑已趁钱。\n几日不来湖上棹，休教重上赣州船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2079,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虞美人","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"营门飒飒惊风雨，一片楚歌中夜起。\n拔山力尽霸业空，八千子弟淮河水。\n腰间宝剑无精光，神龙变作魑魅语。\n美人宛转其奈何，啼痕尽染征袍紫。\n请从剑下化香魂，花枝肯傍秋风主。\n妾心不作青山云，妾身甘作青山土。\n君王若肯报妾身，重向江东整师旅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2080,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺中曲","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"客归青海头，报道单于死。\n晓起望征人，新妆从此理。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2081,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怨诗","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"华屋春将尽，纱窗日易昏。\n不知多少恨，相见与君言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2082,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"绿阴如雨万条斜，啼罢朝莺又晚鸦。\n尽日春风无别意，只吹花点过西家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2083,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春游曲","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"雨余芳草绿新齐，亭树无人绣幕低。\n忽漫好风传笑语，流莺飞过杏花西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2084,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青溪小姑曲","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"十五盈盈学解愁，珠帘不卷倚箜篌。\n多情明月无情水，夜夜青溪映酒楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2085,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双燕离","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"双燕飞，双飞不只栖。\n衔春归柳巷，弄水出花溪。\n惊风起，双燕离，一雄复一雌，一东复一西。\n含啼悲宛转，顾影复差池。\n青天一万里，遥系长相思。\n岧峣桂岭不可度，云軿日暮迷烟雾。\n秋去春来如可逢，宁辞万水千山路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2086,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三妇艳","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"大妇理膏沐，中妇启房栊。\n小妇独无事，但问落花风。\n丈人且安卧，东窗日未红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2087,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"废墓叹","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"废墓丛荆榛，下有妖狐穴。\n哀魂泣杜鹃，化作枫林血。\n颓波声断夕阳空，伤心莫向英雄说。\n恩亦不堪酬，仇亦不堪雪。\n神仙寂灭天地古，世故茫茫几销歇。\n吴王台上望胥江，依然冷浸清秋月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2088,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]